# Takealot Website Project

## Project Overview

This project is a responsive website redesign concept for Takealot. The website is designed to provide users with a simple and user-friendly way to browse products, view product information, and navigate between different sections.

## Website Purpose

The purpose of the website is to create a clear and accessible online shopping experience where users can easily find products and access important information.

## Target Audience

The website is aimed at online shoppers who use e-commerce platforms to search for products, compare available options, and make purchasing decisions. It is designed to be easy to navigate for users with different levels of experience with online shopping.

## Website Features

* Homepage
* Product browsing
* Product information
* Search functionality
* Navigation menu
* Contact information
* Responsive design

## Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## Project Structure

The project contains separate files and folders for the website pages, styling, scripts, research, and images.

